  "content": "[Intro]\n[E5]\n[D5]\n[C5]\n[B5]\n\n[Part 1]\n[E5]\n[D5]\n[C5]\n[B5]\n\n[Part 2]\n[E5]Empty streets fill my mind\n[D5]\n[C5]Autumn has come to numb me\n[B5]blind\n[E5]The end it reaches out for me\n[D5]\n[C5]My soul still calling to be\n[B5]free\n\n[Part 3]\n[E5]\n[D5]\n[C5]\n[B5]\n\n[Part 4]\n[E5]I want the energy to\nbreathe, to\n[D5]clear their poisoned minds\nThe\n[C5]energy I am,\nto\n[B5]end their pointless lives\n\n[Part 2]\n[E5]\n[D5]\n[C5]\n[B5]\n\n[Outro]\n[E5]\n[D5]\n[C5]\n[B5]\n[E5]\n[D5]\n[C5]",
